=== Gopher Civilization Blueprint (house.bp) ===
Last updated: pilot-b, cycle 2

DISTRICTS BUILT (all at y=-12 to y=-5, with floor at y=-12):

 1. ARCHIVES (-150,-12) w=12 h=8  [stone]  - Knowledge vault
 2. TAVERN   (-120,-12) w=10 h=8  [wood]   - Social hub
 3. BAZAAR   (-90,-12)  w=10 h=8  [wood]   - Market (built by a)
 4. LIBRARY  (-47,-12)  w=13 h=8  [stone]  - Learning center (built by a)
 5. ARM-TOWER (60,-12)  w=8  h=10 [stone]  - Defense (built by a)
 6. SPIRE    (100,-12)  w=8  h=10 [stone]  - Magic tower (built by a)
 7. OBSERVATORY (130,-12) w=10 h=8 [stone] - Stargazing (built by a)
 8. GUILD HALL (160,-12) w=12 h=10 [stone] - Grand meeting hall
 9. DOCKS     (200,-12) w=14 h=7  [wood]   - Arrival/port

TUNNEL NETWORK (at y=-13,-14, with stone columns every 20 blocks):
  Archives ←→ Tavern ←→ Bazaar ←→ Library ←→ Arm-Tower ←→ Spire ←→ Observatory ←→ Guild Hall ←→ Docks
  Continuous path from x=-150 to x=213 at y=-13 (floor) and y=-14 (headroom)

BLOCK TYPES:
  0 = air (path, doorway, window)
  1 = stone (walls, floors of important buildings)
  2 = wood (walls, floors of social/economic buildings)
  4 = glass (windows)

NEXT STEPS (suggested):
  - Add staircases from tunnel up to each district floor (y=-13 → y=-12)
  - Build surface landmarks above each district
  - Add interior details (furniture blocks, decorations)
  - Expand east beyond the docks
